"Tunes the garbage collector's aggressiveness by setting the percentage of "
"heap growth allowed before the next collection cycle triggers."
msgstr ""
"通过设置下个垃圾收集周期触发前允许的堆的百分比增速来调节垃圾收集器的激进程度"
"。"

